+| IdP token URL | `EMBEDDINGS_IDP_TOKEN_URL` | `embeddings_idp_token_url` | `extraEnv` | OAuth2 token endpoint (http/https). Required when IdP enabled. |
+| IdP client ID | `EMBEDDINGS_IDP_CLIENT_ID` | `embeddings_idp_client_id` | `extraEnv` | Required when IdP enabled. |
